### Create Ticket

POST http://localhost:3000/api/ticket
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title" : "ComputadorPrueba3",
    "id_department" : "1",
    "id_WorkTeam" : "1",
    "id_device" : "2",
    "id_statusTicket": "1",
    "id_priority" : "1"
}

### 

### Get All tickets

GET http://localhost:3000/api/ticket

###

### Update ticket

PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/ticket/7
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title" : "ComputadorActualizado"
}

